    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d614">

                <pb facs="0739" n="679" xml:id="pg679"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Sir Julian Pauncefote
                        to Mr. Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-21"><hi rendition="#italic">October 21,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to your note, No. 230 of the
                    14th instant, and to previous correspondence concerning the seizure of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Shelby</hi> and certain other British sealing vessels, I
                    have the honor to inform you that I am in receipt of a telegraphic communication
                    from Rear-Admiral Stephenson, informing me that the authorities are awaiting the
                    arrival of the United States naval officers in order to commence the trial of
                    the <hi rendition="#italic">Shelby</hi> and the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Marvin.</hi></p>
                <p>Admiral Stephenson adds that he will communicate further about the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Beatrice.</hi></p>
                <p>I should be much obliged if you would kindly draw the attention of the Secretary
                    of the Treasury to the admiral’s statement about the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Marvin</hi>, in order that suitable action may be taken in regard to the
                    attendance of witnesses in the case.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Julian Pauncefote</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
